---
description: Never silence unused code with #[allow(dead_code)]
alwaysApply: true
---

# No `#[allow(dead_code)]`

Do not add `#[allow(dead_code)]` (or `#[allow(unused)]` to hide dead items).

- **Use** the field, function, or method, or
- Mark test-only helpers `#[cfg(test)]`, or
- **Delete** the unused item (and stop selecting unused SQL columns).

```rust
// BAD
#[allow(dead_code)]
pub id: i64;

// GOOD — drop it, or actually read it
pub content: String;
```

```rust
// BAD
#[allow(dead_code)]
pub fn is_duplicate(&self) -> bool { ... }

// GOOD — only compiled in tests
#[cfg(test)]
pub fn is_duplicate(&self) -> bool { ... }
```
